id: proxy-section-redraw
section: Proxies and certificates
item: After choosing a proxy in Settings → Advanced, the section redraws by itself with no touch: My own proxy picked, its host field is there within the bound; No proxy picked, it is gone
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-proxies-certs.md R1
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="advanced"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="advanced"]' 5
wait rect 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.type"] select' 5
pick 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.type"] select' 4 7
wait rect 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.http"] input' 3
pick 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.type"] select' 0 7
wait gone 'sel:.row[data-pref="network.proxy.http"] input' 2
